			<div class="content" id="post-content-1518469">
									

<p>Not to mention, whenever one cult/sect/pharoa would come into power, a common tactic would be to rewrite things so that the prior group's/person's favored god wasn't so great.. That's how you end up with stories where, say, a god who was once depicted as the right-hand adviser to Ra is now suddenly just a schlub pulling a chariot for other gods..</p>

